---
// Footer.astro - Clean Vercel-Style Footer with Anime Easter Eggs
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-main bg-void py-12 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-main">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-[#22D3EE] flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold text-black">
            YS
          </div>
          <span class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
            Yonko<span class="text-[#22D3EE]">Stash</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted max-w-sm leading-relaxed mb-4" data-i18n="footer.mission">
          The next-generation gaming repository engineered for speed, privacy, and zero ad bloat. Built with Astro & Tailwind CSS v4.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-mist border border-main text-[11px] font-mono text-muted">
          <span class="text-amber-400">⚔️</span>
          <span data-i18n="footer.quote">"If you don't take risks, you can't create a future."</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Categories -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-3" data-i18n="footer.nav_title">
          Navigation
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-muted">
          <li><a href="#bounties" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="nav.all_games">All Bounties</a></li>
          <li><a href="#shinobi-wars" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="nav.shinobi_wars">Shinobi Wars (Action)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#grand-fleet" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="nav.grand_fleet">Grand Fleet (Adventure)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#highest-bounties" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="nav.top_bounties">Highest Bounties</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Community & Status -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-3" data-i18n="footer.guild_title">
          Guild & Status
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-muted">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span data-i18n="footer.mirrors_online">Mirrors: 100% Online</span>
          </li>
          <li><a href="#discord" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="footer.discord">Pirate Syndicate Discord</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="footer.dmca">DMCA / Safe Harbor Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#FF5722] transition-colors" data-i18n="footer.how_to_unzip">How to Unzip & Play</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-muted">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} <span data-i18n="footer.built_for_gamers">YonkoStash. Built for gamers.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-[11px]">
        <span class="hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="footer.no_cookies">No tracking cookies</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span class="hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="footer.zero_malware">Zero redirect malware</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span class="text-[#EF4444]" data-i18n="footer.zoro_lost">Don't get lost like Zoro 🧭</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
